      "widgets_values": [
        "H3 spectrum protected\n\nM5 Ultra test: 864x480, 124 frames, 20 res_multistep/simple steps. Same seed and prompt as the exact workflow. Model loading is excluded from warm timings.\n\nMotionCache requires ComfyUI-MiniMax-H3-MotionCache; keep the native VAEDecode node.\n\nSpectrum needs the separate ComfyUI-Spectrum-MiniMax-H3 package. Its presets are independently tested: keep token reduction, sparse attention and other cache nodes off. Non-bit-exact; compare detail, composition, motion and audio.\n\nSPEED needs ComfyUI-MiniMax-H3-SPEED. Re-run calibration when changing model, LoRA, sampler, steps or geometry; paste the reported coefficients into the SPEED Sampler. Calibration output is logged.\n\nSee benchmarks/m5-ultra-h3-recent-methods.md for measurements and limits."
      ]
    }
